// answers, once, so the lab makes no request. 177 titles, after the 3 Ecchi ones were dropped (spec
// 3G). The two decade pages and trending come first, in AniList's order, which stands in for the
// real pool's popularity order. Tags are kept whole, as [name, rank, flags]: flags 1 is a general
// spoiler, 2 a spoiler for this title, 4 adult. sequel and franchise are the lab's guess from the
// titles (for B2), not AniList's prequel links. Generated by a small script, then formatted; not
// edited by hand.
